---
import SiteLayout from '../../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
---
<SiteLayout title="About | Enterprise IT Fixes" description="How Enterprise IT Fixes creates source-backed troubleshooting guides and field-verified case notes.">
  <div class="page"><Breadcrumbs items={[{label:'About'}]} /><p class="eyebrow">About this project</p><h1 class="page-title">Useful guidance, with its evidence in view.</h1><p class="page-lead">Enterprise IT Fixes is a free reference library for administrators who need a concrete answer to a concrete infrastructure problem.</p>
    <div class="about-grid section"><section class="about-card"><h2>Documented guides</h2><p>These original guides organize a known error or symptom around primary vendor documentation. Each guide links to its sources and is labeled when it has not been tested in a real environment by this site.</p></section><section class="about-card"><h2>Field-verified fixes</h2><p>A guide is labeled field-verified only when a real incident, its root cause, and the fix have been confirmed in the described environment. A vendor source alone does not count as a field verification.</p></section><section class="about-card"><h2>Fast to the answer</h2><p>Each page starts with a short answer, then explains the symptoms, scope, evidence, safe next steps, and how to verify the result.</p></section></div>
    <section class="info-panel"><h2>Suggest a correction</h2><p>There is no account system, comment box, newsletter, or contact form on this site. If a published technical statement needs correction, use the public repository's issue tracker.</p><a class="button" href="https://github.com/mantha0007-cell/enterprise-it-fixes/issues">Open a repository issue</a></section>
  </div>
</SiteLayout>
